email-parking.text:
You rent an apartment in a building in Victoria. The property management company has announced that, starting next month, each underground parking spot will cost $75 a month. Until now, parking was included in your rent.

Write an email to the property manager. In your email:
- describe your current situation;
- explain why this change is a problem for you;
- suggest an alternative.

Write about 150–200 words.

email-daycare.text:
Your four-year-old son attends a licensed daycare in Coquitlam. The daycare has announced that, starting next month, it will close at 5:15 p.m. instead of 6:00 p.m.

Write an email to the daycare director. In your email:
- explain your current situation;
- describe how this change would affect your family;
- suggest a solution.

Write about 150–200 words.
